{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows从挂载设备可疑执行。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Suspicious Execution from a Mounted Device。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows从挂载设备可疑执行","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows从挂载设备可疑执行\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://www.microsoft.com/security/blog/2021/05/27/new-sophisticated-email-based-attack-from-nobelium/","https://www.volexity.com/blog/2021/05/27/suspected-apt29-operation-launches-election-fraud-themed-phishing-campaigns/"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"8a1d4831-3ce6-4859-9891-28931fa6101d","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and process.executable : \"C:\\\\*\" and\n  (\n    process.working_directory : (\"D:\\\\*\", \"E:\\\\*\", \"F:\\\\*\") or\n    ?process.Ext.device.product_id : (\"Virtual DVD-ROM\", \"Virtual Disk\")\n  ) and\n  process.parent.name : \"explorer.exe\" and\n  process.name : (\n    \"rundll32.exe\", \"mshta.exe\", \"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"cmd.exe\", \"regsvr32.exe\", \"cscript.exe\",\n    \"wscript.exe\", \"certutil.exe\", \"bitsadmin.exe\", \"msiexec.exe\", \"wmic.exe\", \"schtasks.exe\", \"msbuild.exe\"\n  )\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1127","name":"Trusted Developer Utilities Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1127/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1127.001","name":"MSBuild","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1127/001/"}]},{"id":"T1218","name":"System Binary Proxy Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1218.005","name":"Mshta","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/005/"},{"id":"T1218.007","name":"Msiexec","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/007/"},{"id":"T1218.010","name":"Regsvr32","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/010/"},{"id":"T1218.011","name":"Rundll32","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1218/011/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1047","name":"Windows Management Instrumentation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1047/"},{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"},{"id":"T1059.003","name":"Windows Command Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/003/"}]},{"id":"T1204","name":"User Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1204.002","name":"Malicious File","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1204/002/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"version":215,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
